From: MichaIng <micha@dietpi.com>
Subject: [PATCH] str: suspend.h: include stdint.h

The header uses uint8_t and uint32_t. They were provided implicitly via stdio.h by newlib 3, but not anymore by recent newlib versions.
---
diff --git a/str/suspend.h b/str/suspend.h
index 90064af..3bfdc49 100644
--- a/str/suspend.h
+++ b/str/suspend.h
@@ -6,6 +6,9 @@
 
 #ifndef __SUSPEND_H__
 #define __SUSPEND_H__
+
+#include <stdint.h>
+
 /* wake up reason*/
 #define UDEFINED_WAKEUP 0
 #define CHARGING_WAKEUP 1
